  "description": "Completion replay for glimmer_hollow (Glimmer Hollow). Takes the tunnel crystal and digs the way into the ring (safe: it is on the glimmer's left). Steps in just after the glimmer passes heading east (tick 169) and goes the other way round, visiting the three pockets on the glimmer's left and waiting in two of them while it goes by. Leaves the ring, takes the far tunnel crystal and turns the vault valve (tick 547): the boulder drops into the open gate and shatters the boxed glimmer below (tick 550), turning to crystal itself and leaving six crystals; the two below the vault walls fall into the basin (tick 556). Takes the one beside the gate on the west, goes down the slot above the gate for the crystal that was the boulder (tick 583) and the one in the glimmer's cell (tick 587), then the one on the east, which is the ninth and opens the exit (tick 619), and the two in the basin. Turns the sluice valve (tick 679): nine units of water drop into the corridor and drown its glimmer (tick 682), which leaves no crystals, settling 1,2,3,2,1 deep. Digs down, wades through and completes at tick 752 with eleven crystals. The ring glimmer survives.",
